932
01:24:08.256 --> 01:24:11.248
You have mesmerized me
to an extent such..

933
01:24:11.326 --> 01:24:17.265
..to an extent such..

934
01:24:19.935 --> 01:24:25.874
..that l lost all my world
and my heart too as much

935
