1069
01:38:35.220 --> 01:38:38.678
l just walked with
you steps a couple

1070
01:38:39.023 --> 01:38:42.186
And l think of sharing with
you my joy and trouble

1071
01:38:42.360 --> 01:38:47.024
This longing.. this love

1072
01:38:47.098 --> 01:38:50.363
This is not just an
illusion, l hope

1073
